release 25
classpath tools/perf/lib/asm-9.9.jar tools/perf/lib/asm-commons-9.9.jar
source tools/port/*.java tools/port/jar/*.java tools/port/jar/sites/*.java tools/port/learn/*.java tools/port/names/*.java tools/port/source/*.java
source tools/cli/Json.java tools/cli/Versions.java tools/cli/Route.java
source tools/tests/JarPort*Test.java tools/tests/Game*Test.java tools/tests/ModNames*Test.java tools/tests/SourceAnswers*Test.java tools/tests/PortPreflightTest.java tools/tests/ChainMapTest.java tools/tests/LegacyMapTest.java

host Sites sites

part RetypedValues retypedValues tools/port/jar/sites/RetypedValues.java | A game field or call result the update gave another type: the mod's uses of the value moved to the new type.
  retyped() resultConverted() unwrapping() onNewType onNewType() movedWith() onType() uses readsTried WIDEN MAYBE

part SuperCalls superCalls tools/port/jar/sites/SuperCalls.java | A mod's super call into a game method or constructor the update moved or removed.
  mixinSuper() superCall() inheritedGone()

part MovedCalls movedCalls tools/port/jar/sites/MovedCalls.java | A call to a method the game or the loader moved: to the call the game's own code switched to, or to where the method went.
  rewritten() relocated() forwardedTo() movedStatic()

part ConvertedCalls convertedCalls tools/port/jar/sites/ConvertedCalls.java | A call whose parameters the update retyped: each argument converted as the game's own callers convert it.
  converted()

part VoidedCalls voidedCalls tools/port/jar/sites/VoidedCalls.java | A call to a method the update deleted with nothing in its place, where the mod can go on without it.
  voided()

part DefaultedArguments defaultedArguments tools/port/jar/sites/DefaultedArguments.java | A call to a method that gained a parameter: the value the game's own callers pass for it.
  defaulted() value()

part ChainedCalls chainedCalls tools/port/jar/sites/ChainedCalls.java | A member the update put behind another call (a field that is now reached through a getter chain).
  chain()

part RuleAnswers ruleAnswers tools/port/jar/sites/RuleAnswers.java | A reference nothing in the game's code answers, answered by a port rule or a stand-in (knowledge/fixes.json, knowledge/standins).
  fix() holds() constants made()

part MovedBodies movedBodies tools/port/jar/sites/MovedBodies.java | Calls inside a method body the port moved to a game method's new parameters: passed the new values where they are at hand.
  given() twin() alone() onOrigin()

part LambdaSites lambdaSites tools/port/jar/sites/LambdaSites.java | Lambdas and method references that implement or name a game method the update changed.
  callback() capturing() handle()

host GameLearner learner

part LearnOverrides learnOverrides tools/port/learn/LearnOverrides.java | What replaced a game method mods override, learned from the game's own overrides of it.
  overrides() stillOverrides()

part LearnByTypes learnByTypes tools/port/learn/LearnByTypes.java | A replacement found by its types alone: the one member or factory of the new release that takes what the old one took and gives what it gave.
  byTypes() ask() instanceMethods instanceMethods() instanceMethodsOf() makes() fromJdk() unchecked() factories() makers makers()

part LearnClassMoves learnClassMoves tools/port/learn/LearnClassMoves.java | Members that went with their class when the game renamed, merged or split it.
  throughClassMap() renamedFamily() narrows() accepts() mapType() assignableB()

part LearnSameMeaning learnSameMeaning tools/port/learn/LearnSameMeaning.java | A removed member whose replacement does the same thing by another route: found by what both bodies compute.
  sameMeaning() wraps() same() slots() oneLine() substitute() through() SAME MARGIN REST covered() meanings meaning() gather() IdentityKey

part LearnAccessors learnAccessors tools/port/learn/LearnAccessors.java | A field the game put behind a getter or setter, and a member now reached through an accessor.
  accessors() reads() writes() throughAccessor()

part LearnConstants learnConstants tools/port/learn/LearnConstants.java | A replacement that depends on the constant passed: one answer per constant, or per class of constant.
  byConstant perConstant() constant() byGroup() byConstantClass()

part LearnHolders learnHolders tools/port/learn/LearnHolders.java | A value the game now hands over wrapped (a Holder, an Optional, a record component) or unwrapped.
  throughHolder() unwrapped() componentOf()

part LearnChains learnChains tools/port/learn/LearnChains.java | Builder chains the game reshaped: the calls that follow a changed call on the same value, read together.
  Chained consumers consumers() chainSites byReceiver bodyOf siblingUse siblingRead() chainRefs chainUse chains chainable() chain() late() lateUse chainRead() voteChains() unsure() MADE

part LearnVotes learnVotes tools/port/learn/LearnVotes.java | The vote over every use the game's own code makes of a changed member: when the uses agree, and what is left out when they do not.
  vote() operandIndex() beyondLiterals() withoutOtherValues() insisting() sameCallUnread() fixedWhereFixed() fixed() keepsOperands() onlyTested() sameTree()

part LearnCompiles learnCompiles tools/port/learn/LearnCompiles.java | Whether a learned expression compiles against the new release, typed as the porter will type it.
  compiles() ways() typeIn() jdkStatic() called() fitsIn() fromJdkClass()

part LearnPairing learnPairing tools/port/learn/LearnPairing.java | Two versions of one method body lined up statement by statement, so a changed use sits opposite what replaced it.
  pair() dropped() explained() pairs() skippable() droppable() returnsReceiver() subtypeA() lambdas() matches() hash() hashA hashB match() head() hole() holed holed() budget

part LearnReading learnReading tools/port/learn/LearnReading.java | One lined-up use read as a replacement expression over the old member's operands.
  read() align() endsLike() fits() givesArgument() merged() mergedMemo express() linesUpThrough() arguments() open() receiver() boxed() primitive() literal() local() mappedName()

part LearnTypeMap learnTypeMap tools/port/learn/LearnTypeMap.java | Types the game replaced by another type everywhere it used them.
  typeVotes typeRewrites typeVote() typeMap()

host GameHop hop

part HopClasses hopClasses tools/port/learn/HopClasses.java | Which class of the new release each class of the old one became, where no published name says so: by nesting, by signature and by likeness.
  nested() memberNames() bodies() Score fuzzyClasses() signatureClasses() signatureVote() kindFollows() unlink() score() outerVote hierarchy() related() moves()

part HopMembers hopMembers tools/port/learn/HopMembers.java | Which method and field of the new release each one of the old became: by name, by rename, by registered id and by who calls it.
  members() newSupers() sameName() renames() Accept mutual() fields() idRenames idRenames() registered() distinctConstant() callers() unlinkedRef() target() vote() accessorScore() similarity() stringsDisagree() RENAME RENAME_SIG MARGIN

part HopRewrites hopRewrites tools/port/learn/HopRewrites.java | Calls the game's own code rewrote between the two releases: the call each old call became, with the evidence for it.
  Rewrite rewrites() typeSafe() receiverCarries() droppedIndices() portable() publicInB() ClassRewrite classRewrites() simpleName()

part HopChains hopChains tools/port/learn/HopChains.java | Members the game put behind a chain of calls, and their siblings that went the same way.
  Evidence templateRefs unlinkedMember Chain Sibling siblings() chains() chain() subtypeB() evidence() unlinkedKey()

part HopArgDefaults hopArgDefaults tools/port/learn/HopArgDefaults.java | Parameters the game added to a method, with the value its own callers pass for them.
  ArgDefault argDefaults() passedByNewCalls() samName() gainedOne() addedIndex() valueOf()
